<ul class=\\\"simple\\\">\\n<li>a metrics table with group, file identifier, file name, metric, value, and\\nstatus columns;</li>\\n<li>a failed-files table with nonzero or unparsable PhyKIT runs; and</li>\\n<li>a summary table with total, selected, processed, failed, and skipped file\\ncounts per group.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>Use suffix or regular-expression filters when a collection contains mixed files,\\nfor example to process only <tt class=\\\"docutils literal\\\">.treefile</tt> members for tree metrics. In ZIP\\nmodes, leaving both filters blank processes every regular archive member and\\nwrites a warning to standard error.</p>\\n</div>\\n\",\n  \"help_format\": \"restructuredtext\",\n  \"hidden\": \"\",\n  \"hidden_versions\": [],\n  \"history_id\": \"bbd44e69cb8906b576067e54f0e048bc\",\n  \"icon\": null,\n  \"id\": \"toolshed.g2.bx.psu.edu/repos/goeckslab/phykit_metrics/phykit_metrics/0.2.0+galaxy0\",\n  \"inputs\": [\n    {\n      \"cases\": [\n        {\n          \"inputs\": [\n            {\n              \"cases\": [\n                {\n                  \"inputs\": [\n                    {\n                      \"argument\": null,\n                      \"default_value\": {\n                        \"values\": [\n                          {\n                            \"id\": \"f9cad7b01a47213590dca36f4c091439\",\n                            \"src\": \"hda\"\n                          }\n                        ]\n                      },\n                      \"edam\": {\n                        \"edam_data\": [\n                          \"data_0872\",\n                          \"data_0006\"\n                        ],\n                        \"edam_formats\": [\n                          \"format_1910\",\n                          \"format_2330\"\n                        ]\n                      },\n                      \"extensions\": [\n                        \"newick\",\n                        \"txt\"\n                      ],\n             